<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Solusersa | Capacitación VIP</title>
  <style>
    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;
      background: linear-gradient(120deg, #001f3f, #0074D9);
      color: white;
      overflow-x: hidden;
    }

    .header {
      background: #001f3f;
      padding: 30px 20px;
      text-align: center;
      box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
    }

    .header h1 {
      font-size: 2.5em;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      color: #00dffc;
    }

    .game-container {
      max-width: 1100px;
      margin: 30px auto;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
      border-radius: 20px;
      padding: 30px;
      box-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(0, 223, 252, 0.3);
    }

    .profile-section {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 25px;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
      border-bottom: 2px solid #00dffc;
      padding-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .avatar {
      width: 120px;
      height: 120px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: url('https://i.imgur.com/VYx9eQl.png') center/cover no-repeat;
      border: 4px solid #00dffc;
    }

    .user-info h2 {
      margin: 0 0 5px;
      color: #ffd700;
    }

    .progress-bar {
      height: 20px;
      background: #ffffff22;
      border-radius: 15px;
      overflow: hidden;
      margin-top: 8px;
    }

    .progress-fill {
      height: 100%;
      background: linear-gradient(to right, #ffcc00, #ff0066);
      width: 70%;
      animation: fillProgress 2s ease-out;
    }

    @keyframes fillProgress {
      from { width: 0%; }
      to { width: 70%; }
    }

    .section-box {
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
      border: 2px solid #ffffff44;
      border-radius: 15px;
      padding: 20px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: all 0.3s ease;
    }

    .section-box:hover {
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.15);
      transform: scale(1.02);
    }

    .hidden-content {
      display: none;
      margin-top: 10px;
      animation: fadeIn 0.5s ease-in-out;
    }

    @keyframes fadeIn {
      from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(10px); }
      to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
    }

    .badges img {
      width: 60px;
      margin: 8px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      transition: all 0.3s ease-in-out;
    }

    .badges img:hover {
      transform: scale(1.15) rotate(3deg);
      filter: brightness(1.2);
    }

    .level-board {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(160px, 1fr));
      gap: 20px;
    }

    .level-tile {
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
      border: 2px solid #00dffc;
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 15px;
      text-align: center;
      font-weight: bold;
      transition: transform 0.3s ease;
    }

    .level-tile:hover {
      transform: translateY(-5px);
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.2);
    }

    footer {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 20px;
      background: #001f3f;
      margin-top: 40px;
      font-size: 0.9em;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="header">
  <h1>🌟 Capacitación VIP Solusersa</h1>
  <p>Transformamos el reclutamiento en una experiencia memorable.</p>
</div>

<div class="game-container">

  <div class="profile-section">
    <div class="avatar"></div>
    <div class="user-info">
      <h2>Bienvenido, Usuario VIP</h2>
      <p>Nivel: 3 - Ejecutivo Ascendente</p>
      <div class="progress-bar">
        <div class="progress-fill"></div>
      </div>
      <p>Experiencia: 70 / 100</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="section-box" onclick="toggleContent('missions')">
    🎯 Misiones del Día
    <div class="hidden-content" id="missions">
      <p>✅ Finaliza la validación de CV para ganar 30 XP.</p>
      <audio src="https://cdn.pixabay.com/audio/2022/03/15/audio_b1f900c8d0.mp3" autoplay></audio>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="section-box" onclick="toggleContent('badges')">
    🏅 Logros y Recompensas
    <div class="hidden-content" id="badges">
      <div class="badges">
        <img src="https://cdn-icons-png.flaticon.com/512/2278/2278992.png" title="Líder del mes">
        <img src="https://cdn-icons-png.flaticon.com/512/2278/2278996.png" title="Cazatalentos experto">
        <img src="https://cdn-icons-png.flaticon.com/512/2278/2278977.png" title="100% Evaluaciones completadas">
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="section-box" onclick="toggleContent('levels')">
    🗺️ Tablero de Niveles
    <div class="hidden-content" id="levels">
      <div class="level-board">
        <div class="level-tile">Nivel 1<br><small>Iniciador</small></div>
        <div class="level-tile">Nivel 2<br><small>Analista</small></div>
        <div class="level-tile">Nivel 3<br><small>Ejecutivo</small></div>
        <div class="level-tile">Nivel 4<br><small>Supervisor</small></div>
        <div class="level-tile">Nivel 5<br><small>Gerente</small></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

</div>

<footer>
  &copy; 2025 Solusersa | Innovación en Reclutamiento
</footer>

<script>
  function toggleContent(id) {
    const el = document.getElementById(id);
    el.style.display = el.style.display === 'block' ? 'none' : 'block';
  }
</script>

</body>
